      "text": [
        " اَلرَّجُلِ يَقَعُ عَلَى أُخْتِهِ قَالَ \"يُضْرَبُ ضَرْبَةً بِالسَّيْفِ بَلَغَتْ مِنْهُ مَا بَلَغَتْ فَإِنْ عَاشَ خُلِّدَ فِي اَلْحَبْسِ حَتَّى يَمُوتَ\"."
      ],
      "translations": {
        "en.bab-ul-qaim-publications": [
          "Hadith.3261 - Safwan ibn Mihran narrated from Amir ibn al-Simt, from Imam Ali ibn Al-Hussain (as) regarding a man who commits intercourse with his sister.\nImam (as) said: \"He is struck with a sword, and whatever injury it causes will be his fate. If he survives, he is to be imprisoned for life until he dies.\""
        ]
      }
